  "solution": "Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>30</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là quãng đường máy bay di chuyển được sau <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>t</mi></semantics></math> giây kể từ lúc bắt đầu chạy đà.<br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là một nguyên hàm của hàm số vận tốc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Sử dụng tính chất của nguyên hàm, ta được\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tKhi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tLại có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa được <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></semantics></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tMáy bay rời đường bằng khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></semantics></math> giây nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>500</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVậy quãng đường máy bay đã di chuyển kể từ khi bắt đầu chạy đà đến khi rời đường bằng là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>500</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m.",
